  Docs\LEVEL1.md:73:| --- | --- | --- | --- |
  Docs\LEVEL1.md:74:| `pm_open_level1` | Start | PM | Morning. Three thousand feet, three crews. Dig Day 1, pipe Day 
2, backfill Day 4. We promised the city Day 18, so keep everybody moving. |
  Docs\LEVEL1.md:75:| `pm_hold_level1` | Plan holds a crew | PM | You're holding a crew? We promised Day 18. I hope 
you have a reason. |
  Docs\LEVEL1.md:76:| `pm_end_level1` | End | PM | That's the run. Look at where the lines ended up against what we 
promised. |
  Docs\LEVEL1.md:77:| `marcus_collapse` | The wall falls | Marcus | Three turns, as in `VOICE.md` |
  Docs\LEVEL1.md:78:| `arg_back_pipe_stopped` | Backfill catches a stopped pipe crew | Dana, Marcus | Four turns, as 
